(6883371, 1037564, 93171, '<td valign="top">Ugh.  I can honestly say this is one of my favorite images from this challenge so far, but the challenge clearly says to include a tree or trees.  I''m giving a 6, but I would''ve given a higher score if it was entered in another challenge or if this challenge wasn''t so specific.</td>', 'Ugh.  I can honestly say this is one of my favorite images from this challenge so far, but the challenge clearly says to include a tree or trees.  I''m giving a 6, but I would''ve given a higher score if it was entered in another challenge or if this challenge wasn''t so specific.', '2012-10-15 09:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
