(6885143, 1037584, 66296, '<td valign="top">I find this one powerful. It tells the story of two trees growing for decades and constantly adopting to each other, like a good and long marriage.</td>', 'I find this one powerful. It tells the story of two trees growing for decades and constantly adopting to each other, like a good and long marriage.', '2012-10-17 16:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885274, 1037521, 152656, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot!  The color seems to surround the trunk of the tree three dimensionally with the leaves on the grass at the bottom of the tree in the foreground and the orange and yellow leaves above and in the background.   I think this automatically draws your eye to the detail in the bark. Call me a rookie, but it took two viewings to notice the cute green house in the background.<br/> <br/>Not a very technical note, but I know when I see a photo I like.....and this is one of them!  Great job!!</td>', 'I think this is a great shot!  The color seems to surround the trunk of the tree three dimensionally with the leaves on the grass at the bottom of the tree in the foreground and the orange and yellow leaves above and in the background.   I think this automatically draws your eye to the detail in the bark. Call me a rookie, but it took two viewings to notice the cute green house in the background. Not a very technical note, but I know when I see a photo I like.....and this is one of them!  Great job!!', '2012-10-17 22:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885279, 1037413, 152656, '<td valign="top">I never seem to have my camera handy when an opportunity like this happens.  Nice shot!</td>', 'I never seem to have my camera handy when an opportunity like this happens.  Nice shot!', '2012-10-17 22:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885575, 1037056, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nicely controlled zoom.  It seems that this is either a crop of a much larger image which was centered on the girl, or you somehow kept the focus on the girl while zooming, even though she is not at the center. I''ll be interested to find out more :-)   Love the warm colors.</td>', 'Nicely controlled zoom.  It seems that this is either a crop of a much larger image which was centered on the girl, or you somehow kept the focus on the girl while zooming, even though she is not at the center. I''ll be interested to find out more :-)   Love the warm colors.', '2012-10-18 14:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885583, 1037592, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like the trunk disappearing into the canopy of leaves, but I think the image would hold my interest longer if there was more contrast within the leaves.  For my taste, the leaves are too close to being a uniform blur of red.<br/> <br/>ETA: Since this is a minimal editing challenge, I guess that would mean taking the picture in different light.</td>', 'I like the trunk disappearing into the canopy of leaves, but I think the image would hold my interest longer if there was more contrast within the leaves.  For my taste, the leaves are too close to being a uniform blur of red. ETA: Since this is a minimal editing challenge, I guess that would mean taking the picture in different light.', '2012-10-18 14:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
