(6885933, 1037538, 152656, '<td valign="top">I think creativity plays a major role in why I gave this photo a pretty high rating.  For starters the black &amp; white image neutralizes the grass and any color in the wall and draws focus to the high contrast in the tree''s shadow on the wall.  In the same manner the intense light on the trunk draws attention to the actual tree.<br/> <br/>I like it!!</td>', 'I think creativity plays a major role in why I gave this photo a pretty high rating.  For starters the black & white image neutralizes the grass and any color in the wall and draws focus to the high contrast in the tree''s shadow on the wall.  In the same manner the intense light on the trunk draws attention to the actual tree. I like it!!', '2012-10-19 01:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885939, 1037597, 152656, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2012-10-19 01:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885956, 1037507, 152656, '<td valign="top">There isn''t a tree to be found in this entry.......there was to be at least 1 tree....  I do like the ''creative'' side of this photo and would have rated it higher if there was even a small tree in a pot at the end of the aisle.<br/> <br/>All in all I like the shot, but it''s missing the basic requirement of the challenge.  Good luck! I hope you do well anyway!</td>', 'There isn''t a tree to be found in this entry.......there was to be at least 1 tree....  I do like the ''creative'' side of this photo and would have rated it higher if there was even a small tree in a pot at the end of the aisle. All in all I like the shot, but it''s missing the basic requirement of the challenge.  Good luck! I hope you do well anyway!', '2012-10-19 01:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
