(6887221, 1037466, 108580, '<td valign="top">Good composition, with nice elements barring the shrub at right, the fenceline, the mountain, the fence posts etc. I might have tried adding extra light to the tree with off camera flash or hot shoe flash, not the popup, its too weak Amanda :) Or were you going for silhouette? Warm tones either golden hour or white balance to cloudy or both :) Good work.</td>', 'Good composition, with nice elements barring the shrub at right, the fenceline, the mountain, the fence posts etc. I might have tried adding extra light to the tree with off camera flash or hot shoe flash, not the popup, its too weak Amanda :) Or were you going for silhouette? Warm tones either golden hour or white balance to cloudy or both :) Good work.', '2012-10-21 06:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
