(6887256, 1037089, 138630, '<td valign="top">A nice, strong, almost silhouette and lovely light.  I like the contrast between the heavy, solid looking trunks, lower branches and rocks and light, misty look of the wispy small tree behind the rock and the distant shoreline.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'A nice, strong, almost silhouette and lovely light.  I like the contrast between the heavy, solid looking trunks, lower branches and rocks and light, misty look of the wispy small tree behind the rock and the distant shoreline.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-21 11:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6887258, 1037481, 138630, '<td valign="top">Pretty - the title says it just right.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Pretty - the title says it just right.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-21 11:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6887259, 1036845, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  I love the abstract nature of this and especially the bright "star-like" bursts of color you achieved.</td>', 'Wonderful image.  I love the abstract nature of this and especially the bright "star-like" bursts of color you achieved.', '2012-10-21 11:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6887261, 1037172, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines in both the road and the rail fence.  A very pretty autumn scene.,  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Nice leading lines in both the road and the rail fence.  A very pretty autumn scene.,  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-21 11:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6887262, 1037116, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the color and light of the sunset and that you almost isolated the front tree so it stands alone yet is echoed by the others.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Love the color and light of the sunset and that you almost isolated the front tree so it stands alone yet is echoed by the others.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-21 11:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6887263, 1037598, 138630, '<td valign="top">Pretty light and a strong silhouette.  The curving shoreline is particularly nice with the light catching.</td>', 'Pretty light and a strong silhouette.  The curving shoreline is particularly nice with the light catching.', '2012-10-21 11:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6887264, 1037476, 138630, '<td valign="top">I was surprised not to see more infrared shots, what it does to green is always so startling.  No exception here - looks like ice.  Very nice.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I was surprised not to see more infrared shots, what it does to green is always so startling.  No exception here - looks like ice.  Very nice.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-21 11:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
