(6887589, 1037068, 10785, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silver clouds! I think this shot is missing some nice foreground objects and something to lead the viewer into the scene. The lines are all going side to side with nothing to draw me in compositionally.</td>', 'Beautiful silver clouds! I think this shot is missing some nice foreground objects and something to lead the viewer into the scene. The lines are all going side to side with nothing to draw me in compositionally.', '2012-10-21 22:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
