(6887691, 1037172, 12611, '<td valign="top">I am thinking to myself, it doesn''t alter the mood and colors and values of the shot, which I very much like, but the asphalt kind of takes away from the oldness feel. Still gave you an 8!</td>', 'I am thinking to myself, it doesn''t alter the mood and colors and values of the shot, which I very much like, but the asphalt kind of takes away from the oldness feel. Still gave you an 8!', '2012-10-21 23:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
