(6887921, 1037569, 104230, '<td valign="top">I wrote a comment on this during voting but must have exited without saving it. Possibly influenced by your title I see these as a group which is gathered, leaning in toward each other to exchange confidences with each other.. The amount of blur is well controlled. I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I wrote a comment on this during voting but must have exited without saving it. Possibly influenced by your title I see these as a group which is gathered, leaning in toward each other to exchange confidences with each other.. The amount of blur is well controlled. I gave it an 8.', '2012-10-22 01:28:39.000000', NULL, 0),
