(6887927, 1037466, 86218, '<td valign="top">Baie geluk Amanda met jou top 10 plasing hier. Uitstekende shot en ek is verbaas oor hoe bruin dit nog by julle lyk...gehoop dit is al bietjie groener. Mag die reens kom...en gou</td>', 'Baie geluk Amanda met jou top 10 plasing hier. Uitstekende shot en ek is verbaas oor hoe bruin dit nog by julle lyk...gehoop dit is al bietjie groener. Mag die reens kom...en gou', '2012-10-22 01:31:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6887928, 1037135, 67697, '<td valign="top">haha me telling J how to edit a photo.  I had a tiny thought that maybe the photog left in the two sidebars intentionally but ah left my comment anyway.  However, I would have cropped off some of the top because you almost have a diagonal with those three trees and it''s more apparent that way.  But like I said, it just feels awkward giving you my opinion :D</td>', 'haha me telling J how to edit a photo.  I had a tiny thought that maybe the photog left in the two sidebars intentionally but ah left my comment anyway.  However, I would have cropped off some of the top because you almost have a diagonal with those three trees and it''s more apparent that way.  But like I said, it just feels awkward giving you my opinion :D', '2012-10-22 01:31:20.000000', NULL, 0),
