(6888018, 1037509, 69008, '<td valign="top">This would have probably placed much higher if you had been able to include the whole tree. <br/>Another problem is that this is posted much smaller than the 800 pixel longest side, size that is allowed in the challenges, making it appear much smaller than the other photos in the challenge. <br/>It''s a beautiful tree though, and the blue sky is a big plus. A lower angle would have shown more of that awesome fall sky to give the tree more punch in the image. <br/>Keep shootin''.</td>', 'This would have probably placed much higher if you had been able to include the whole tree. Another problem is that this is posted much smaller than the 800 pixel longest side, size that is allowed in the challenges, making it appear much smaller than the other photos in the challenge. It''s a beautiful tree though, and the blue sky is a big plus. A lower angle would have shown more of that awesome fall sky to give the tree more punch in the image. Keep shootin''.', '2012-10-22 02:33:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6888035, 1037568, 113591, '<td valign="top">The natural framing is beautiful.<br/>And of course the light.<br/>And the flare.<br/>And the comp..<br/>I''ll stop now, it is a beautiful image. Thanks.<br/></td>', 'The natural framing is beautiful.And of course the light.And the flare.And the comp..I''ll stop now, it is a beautiful image. Thanks.', '2012-10-22 03:14:42.000000', NULL, 0),
